        "loc_flying_frost_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Blood path is called even more vile than using soul path techniques to burn human souls.",
      "chapters": [
        835
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ranked-among-vile-acts",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "path_blood"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Souls are common Gu refinement materials for soul path Gu worms. In a batch fed to Dang Hun Mountain, beast souls are most common, plant souls appear too, and variant human and human souls are fewest. Stronger life forms and higher intelligence raise soul quality. With few fierce beasts, no desolate beasts, and very few variant human and human souls, that batch yields fewer guts Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        996
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
